dsh-plugin-backup README · Development：- `@deepseek-ai/dsh-typert-loader`'s `validateTypertManifest` validates the host descriptors;
- the real `TypertRegistry` registers all nine endpoints;
- the real `dsh-tools` `defineTool` compiles the six tool schemas;
- a real `@deepseek-ai/cordis` root mounts the plugin and drives the download route over real archives;
- the browser half is rendered through a module-loader shim plus a minimal hooks runtime, with the
  client descriptor table compared field by field against the host contribution.
